  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Violent Extremism in West Africa UNODC</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthen the awareness and capacities of prison administrations to address the challenge of violent extremism in prison setting. To initiate a regional West African dynamic, cooperate and initiate cooperation around five French-speaking countries (Benin, Guinea, Ivory Coast, Senegal, and Togo) that have been recently confronted to terrorism, directly or indirectly (threats, attacks, recruitment of fighters, investigations for international financing, dismantling of cells</narrative>
  </description>
